--- Example 1 — Multi-tenant SaaS for restaurant management ---

Project description:
The client operates a chain of 12 restaurants and needs a web SaaS where each venue
has its own account. The platform must cover a digital POS (table management, order
taking, split billing), real-time kitchen display, inventory management with low-stock
alerts, and a monthly reporting dashboard exportable to PDF. Integration with Stripe
for payments and with three local suppliers' APIs for automatic restocking orders.

Estimation:

# Estimation: Multi-Tenant Restaurant SaaS

## Executive summary
Complex multi-tenant platform combining real-time POS operations, third-party payment
and supplier integrations, and a reporting layer. The real-time kitchen display and
multi-tenant data isolation are the highest-risk items.

