| Sync adapter: push local mutations with conflict resolution | 16h | Mobile Engineer | Last-write-wins + merge log |
| Photo upload queue (background, retry on reconnect) | 12h | Mobile Engineer | Expo FileSystem + queue |
| **Subtotal** | **56h** | | |

