| Metabase Cloud setup, BigQuery connection | 2h | Analytics Engineer | |
| CAC, LTV, retention dashboards (3 dashboards, ~12 charts) | 16h | Analytics Engineer | |
| Self-service filter parameters (date range, channel, country) | 8h | Analytics Engineer | |
| CAC threshold alert (email) via Metabase alerts | 4h | Analytics Engineer | |
| **Subtotal** | **30h** | | |

### 5. Infrastructure & Documentation
