## Main risks & assumptions
1. Attribution model (last-click) must be agreed upfront; switching to data-driven attribution later would require rewriting the CAC model.
2. Shopify historical export may be rate-limited; a dedicated backfill window of 5–7 days should be planned.
3. Airbyte Cloud costs are not included in the estimate; expected €60–120/month depending on sync frequency.

**Delivery range:** 9–11 weeks · 148–168 h
